          "source": "https://chain.link/article/yield-bearing-stablecoins-explained",
          "thread": "TradFi giants entering yield stablecoins",
          "why": "BlackRock BUIDL partnering with Elixir/Curve for deUSD (748 clicks) and Franklin Templeton enabling peer-to-peer BENJI transfers signaled institutional validation that dwarfed every other angle."
        },
        {
          "source": "https://www.bis.org/fsi/fsibriefs27.htm",
          "thread": "Banks lobbying against on-chain yield",
          "why": "The regulatory fight over whether yield-bearing stablecoins legally compete with bank deposits framed the entire category as a systemic threat to incumbents, making the stakes concrete for readers."
        },
        {
          "source": "https://1inch.com/blog/post/what-are-yield-bearing-stablecoins",
          "thread": "Funding-rate slump crushing basis yields",
          "why": "The collapse of basis-trade profits eroding USDe and peer yields gave readers a real-money mechanism explaining why high advertised APYs are unstable, not just theoretical risk."
        },
        {
          "source": "https://app.rwa.xyz/assets/$R2USD",
          "thread": "Tokenized RWA treasury backing",
          "why": "Projects like R2 Protocol (Binance Alpha) and USD.AI tying stablecoin yield to tokenized T-bills positioned RWA backing as the 'safe' alternative to funding-rate-dependent yield, drawing readers comparing durability."
        },
        {
          "source": "https://www.prnewswire.com/apac/news-releases/bybit-introduces-yield-bearing-gold-product-offering-apr-on-tokenized-gold-302718722.html",
          "thread": "Yield-bearing beyond stablecoins",
          "why": "Bybit's tokenized gold savings products, Lombard's yield-bearing LBTC, and GammaSwap's gETH showed readers the mechanic expanding to BTC and commodities, broadening the category's relevance."
        },
        {
          "source": "https://x.com/chainlink/status/2054532287660765692?lang=en",
          "thread": "Protocol standards and vault mechanics",
          "why": "EIP-7540's async vault improvements and Pendle's principal/yield token splitting attracted readers who wanted the infrastructure layer — how composability and yield stripping actually work under the hood."
        }
      ]
